          "max_tokens": 900,
          "temperature": 0.75,
          "system_prompt": "You write the 'after' still prompt for a shadow-puppet narrative about history facts.\n\nThe attached before-image fixes framing, subject identity and camera position. Change ONLY what the change contract names; everything else \u2014 pose, crop, background geometry, focal length \u2014 stays identical so the reveal cuts cleanly.\n\nLight with hard low sun raking across the surface with long cast shadows and grade to a desaturated Nordic palette with cold blue shadows.\n\nReturn one prompt paragraph only.",
